  "description": {
    "text": "In 2009 each BK Kids Meal at Burger King came with two Pokémon TCG cards and one of six Pokémon accessories, among them card holders, lenticular rockers and card frames. The promotion ran for three weeks in the US and Canada from 1 June 2009, and a four- to six-week one was to follow in South America from 24 August. Each of the 12 cards reprints a Majestic Dawn, Great Encounters, Legends Awakened or Stormfront card, keeping its number, in reverse holo with the Platinum logo stamped on the bottom right of its picture.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "PocketMonsters.net: The Pokemon Company International Highlights Banner Year With Major Burger King Promotion (the press release)",
        "url": "https://pocketmonsters.net/news/535"
      },
